        "text": "I have enough to draft. Two key findings reshape my recommendation:\n\n1. **Schema uses `jsonb`** (D1 doesn't support it) — so a Phase 1 with **Hyperdrive + Neon Postgres** is far more pragmatic than D1, and zero-schema-port. D1 becomes Phase 2 if/when you commit to a SQLite migration.\n2. **Express → Workers** is the trickiest seam. Cleanest path: refactor route handlers behind a transport-agnostic shape, with adapters for Express (today) and Hono (Workers). This is the largest upstream change but improves testability for everyone — likely mergeable.\n\nWriting the plan doc now.",
